# The picker filters projects by name with their paths; Enter makes one the destination, keeping the text as typed.
file <<END
Work:
	Launch:
		- Draft plan
Home:
	Garden:
END
keys qq
type Book venue
keys <Space> /
see Launch  Work
type lau
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Work › Launch
see - Book venue
keys <Enter>
status Added to Launch
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	Launch:
		- Draft plan
		- Book venue
Home:
	Garden:
END
